    "text": "直到遇见你我以为就光明起来",
    "startMs": 6800,
    "endMs": 9766,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "startFrame": 204,
    "endFrameExclusive": 293
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "眼睛里看到的都是广袤无垠的大海",
    "startMs": 10066,
    "endMs": 13566,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "startFrame": 302,
    "endFrameExclusive": 407
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "有你在的日子里不可能被取代",
    "startMs": 13600,
    "endMs": 16766,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "startFrame": 408,
    "endFrameExclusive": 503
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "在最灰暗的日子你陪着我发呆",
    "startMs": 16866,
    "endMs": 19933,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "startFrame": 506,
    "endFrameExclusive": 598
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "你让我学会如何拨开阴霾",
    "startMs": 19933,
    "endMs": 22800,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "startFrame": 598,
    "endFrameExclusive": 684
  },
  {
